      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a new training module for a metropolitan police department. We're focusing on de-escalation and situational awareness for officers patrolling high-density urban areas. Can you help me draft a list of behavioral indicators or \"red flags\" that an officer might see that suggest an individual or a group might be planning criminal activity or posing an immediate threat? We want to help them spot potential issues before they escalate.",
