      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should focus on observable behaviors rather than assumptions about individuals. Some indicators might include erratic movement, excessive loitering in restricted areas, or furtive glances around the environment. Pay attention to groups exhibiting overly coordinated or tense body language. These signs can help officers maintain situational awareness in crowded settings.",
